{"page":74,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:181","surah":3,"ayah":181,"ar_uthmani":"لَّقَدْ سَمِعَ ٱللَّهُ قَوْلَ ٱلَّذِينَ قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ فَقِيرٌ وَنَحْنُ أَغْنِيَآءُ ۘ سَنَكْتُبُ مَا قَالُوا۟ وَقَتْلَهُمُ ٱلْأَنۢبِيَآءَ بِغَيْرِ حَقٍّ وَنَقُولُ ذُوقُوا۟ عَذَابَ ٱلْحَرِيقِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God has certainly heard the words of those who sneer, ‘So God is poor, while we are rich’. We shall record everything they say––as well as their killing of prophets in defiance of all that is right- and We shall say to them, ‘Taste the torment of the scorching fire.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّقَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَمِعَ","en_gloss":"heard","transliteration":"samiʿa","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَوْلَ","en_gloss":"(the) saying","transliteration":"qawla","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَقِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) poor","transliteration":"faqīrun","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَنَحْنُ","en_gloss":"while we","transliteration":"wanaḥnu","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَغْنِيَآءُ ۘ","en_gloss":"(are) rich","transliteration":"aghniyāu","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":12,"ar":"سَنَكْتُبُ","en_gloss":"We will record","transliteration":"sanaktubu","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"3:181"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَقَتْلَهُمُ","en_gloss":"and their killing","transliteration":"waqa