"3:182"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٨٢","en_gloss":"(182)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:182"}]},{"verse_key":"3:183","surah":3,"ayah":183,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَهِدَ إِلَيْنَآ أَلَّا نُؤْمِنَ لِرَسُولٍ حَتَّىٰ يَأْتِيَنَا بِقُرْبَانٍ تَأْكُلُهُ ٱلنَّارُ ۗ قُلْ قَدْ جَآءَكُمْ رُسُلٌ مِّن قَبْلِى بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ وَبِٱلَّذِى قُلْتُمْ فَلِمَ قَتَلْتُمُوهُمْ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰدِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"To those who say, ‘God has commanded us not to believe in any messenger unless he brings us an offering that fire [from heaven] consumes,’ say [Prophet], ‘Messengers before me have come to you with clear signs, including the one you mention. If you are sincere, why did you kill them?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَهِدَ","en_gloss":"(has) taken promise","transliteration":"ʿahida","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"from us","transliteration":"ilaynā","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"that not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نُؤْمِنَ","en_gloss":"we (should) believe","transliteration":"nu'mina","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِرَسُولٍ","en_gloss":"in a Messenger","transliteration":"lirasūlin","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَأْتِيَنَا","en_gloss":"he brings to us","transliteration":"yatiyanā","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِقُرْبَانٍۢ","en_gloss":"a sacrifice ","transliteration":"biqur'bānin","verse_key":"3:183"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَأْكُلُهُ","en_gloss":"consumes it","transliteration":"takuluhu","vers