en_gloss":"(of) delusion","transliteration":"l-ghurūri","verse_key":"3:185"},{"pos":24,"ar":"١٨٥","en_gloss":"(185)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:185"}]},{"verse_key":"3:186","surah":3,"ayah":186,"ar_uthmani":"۞ لَتُبْلَوُنَّ فِىٓ أَمْوَٰلِكُمْ وَأَنفُسِكُمْ وَلَتَسْمَعُنَّ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ مِن قَبْلِكُمْ وَمِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوٓا۟ أَذًى كَثِيرًا ۚ وَإِن تَصْبِرُوا۟ وَتَتَّقُوا۟ فَإِنَّ ذَٰلِكَ مِنْ عَزْمِ ٱلْأُمُورِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"you are sure to be tested through your possessions and persons; you are sure to hear much that is hurtful from those who were given the Scripture before you and from those who associate others with God. If you are steadfast and mindful of God, that is the best course.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ لَتُبْلَوُنَّ","en_gloss":"You will certainly be tested","transliteration":"latub'lawunna","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْوَٰلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your wealth","transliteration":"amwālikum","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأَنفُسِكُمْ","en_gloss":"and yourselves","transliteration":"wa-anfusikum","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَتَسْمَعُنَّ","en_gloss":"And you will certainly hear","transliteration":"walatasmaʿunna","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُوتُوا۟","en_gloss":"were given","transliteration":"ūtū","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَبْلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablikum","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"and from","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"3:186"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ